          "page": "2",
          "section": "2. Experimental procedure",
          "quote": "Using high purity of Al (99.999 wt%), Sc (99.99 wt%), Ti (99.999 wt%) and Zr (99.99 wt%) as starting materials, samples of Al5Sc25Ti35Zr35 (Al5), Al10Sc20Ti35Zr35 (Al10) and Al15Sc15Ti35Zr35 (Al15) in atomic percent, 4 g in weight, were arc-melted under the protection of the argon atmosphere. Each sample was melted and flipped four times to ensure the homogeneity, with a Ti-ball as the getter.",
